<pre><code class="language-md">Here's a simple footnote,[^1] and here's a longer one.[^bignote]

[^1]: meaningful!

[^bignote]: Here's one with multiple paragraphs and code.

    Indent paragraphs to include them in the footnote.

    `{ my code }`

    Add as many paragraphs as you like.
</code></pre>
<p>Here's a simple footnote,<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup> and here's a longer one.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-bignote" id="fnref-bignote" data-footnote-ref>2</a></sup></p>
<pre><code class="language-md">You can also use inline footnotes. ^[notice that the carat goes outside of the brackets on this one.]
</code></pre>
<p>You can also use inline footnotes. ^[notice that the carat goes outside of the brackets on this one.]</p>
<section class="footnotes" data-footnotes>
<ol>
<li id="fn-1">
<p>meaningful! <a href="#fnref-1" class="footnote-backref" data-footnote-backref data-footnote-backref-idx="1" aria-label="Back to reference 1">↩</a></p>
</li>
<li id="fn-bignote">
<p>Here's one with multiple paragraphs and code.</p>
<p>Indent paragraphs to include them in the footnote.</p>
<p><code>{ my code }</code></p>
<p>Add as many paragraphs as you like. <a href="#fnref-bignote" class="footnote-backref" data-footnote-backref data-footnote-backref-idx="2" aria-label="Back to reference 2">↩</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
